# my-notion-app

Personal Notion-style PWA: weekly tasks, group tasks, dashboard, admin, notifications.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4, Lucide icons
- Redux Toolkit (`src/store/`), React Context (auth, theme)
- Supabase (client + server actions), Firebase, local storage strategies for weekly tasks
- React Compiler enabled via `babel-plugin-react-compiler`

## Paths

- Import from `@/` → `src/` (see `tsconfig.json` paths)
- Do not introduce new path aliases without updating `tsconfig.json`

## Folder layout

| Area | Location |
|------|----------|
| Routes & layouts | `src/app/` — route groups `(main)`, `(admin)` |
| Shared UI | `src/common/`, `src/components/` |
| Feature modules | `src/features/<name>/` (components, actions, services) |
| Global types | `src/types/` |
| Hooks | `src/hooks/` |
| App services | `src/services/` |
| Storage strategies | `src/lib/storage/` |
| Supabase client | `src/lib/supabase/client.ts` |

## Agent behavior

- Prefer minimal diffs; match existing naming and file placement
- Only commit or push when the user explicitly asks
